  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      66.71,
      471.85,
      82.25
    ],
    "text": "Public Assistance Requested to Identify Unidentified Deceased Person",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      96.83,
      514.65,
      144.53
    ],
    "text": "The Police request public assistance in identifying an unidentified male who died following a road accident that occurred on 17 July 2026 in the Indiparape area along the Giriulla\u2013Pasyala Road within the Mirigama Police Division.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      159.11,
      524.69,
      206.81
    ],
    "text": "The victim, who sustained critical injuries in the accident, died at the scene. The identity of the deceased has not yet been established, as the body was severely damaged due to the impact of the accident and could not be identified.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      221.39,
      524.77,
      269.12
    ],
    "text": "The deceased is believed to be a male approximately 55 years of age, around 5 feet 2 inches in height, with a full beard. At the time of the accident, he was wearing light green long trousers and a short-sleeved T-shirt of the same colour.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      283.7,
      451.93,
      299.24
    ],
    "text": "The body has been placed at the Wathupitiwala Hospital Mortuary.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      313.82,
      484.49,
      345.44
    ],
    "text": "The Police Media Division kindly requests media institutions to assist by publicising this information to help identify the deceased.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      360.02,
      513.22,
      391.64
    ],
    "text": "Members of the public who have any information regarding the identity of the deceased are requested to contact the following telephone numbers:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
